WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:06.000
Conceptual animation, not measured model embeddings.
Near the safety boundary, surface cues can obscure intent.

00:06.000 --> 00:12.000
Construct matched Safe-to-Unsafe and Unsafe-to-Safe instructions.
Preserve the semantic frame; change the safety-critical factor.

00:12.000 --> 00:18.000
BCFT and SCR encourage safety-relevant representation shifts
while preserving shared non-safety utility. Geometry is illustrative.

00:18.000 --> 00:24.000
Safe instructions receive helpful compliance.
Unsafe instructions receive refusal or safe pivot. Both responses are safe.
